# Attach an extra "shot" of the SAME person to an existing identity.
#
# Multi-template galleries matter whenever appearance changes: glasses on/off,
# a different hairstyle, a different camera/lighting. With a single template the
# owner can then score *lower* than an unrelated face, and no threshold fixes it
# (see the recogniser notes: a second template of the same person is the cure).
string id           # target identity, as returned by AddFace / ListFaces
string image_data   # base64-encoded JPEG/PNG of the same person
---
bool success
string message
int32 templates     # total templates on this identity after the call
